      "id": 1,
      "text": "Concord was renamed \"Concord\" in 1765 by Governor Benning Wentworth to symbolize harmony after a boundary dispute.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        10,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
